    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Perfectly organized",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Enter all individual components, complete tools, and setup sheets in a central database.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8122",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Lossless interfaces",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With numerous interfaces, you can connect the ZOLLER TMS to your CAM systems—the error-free digital transmission of tool data saves time, worry, and money.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8124",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Stock Management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Every part lies in its place – with ZOLLER-TMS, you always know where your components and tools are located. At the same time, you can efficiently keep track of your stock levels.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8126",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "tool monitoring",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Bring quality control and wear analysis together in one place, check the use of your tools, and generate statistics on individual orders and your costs.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8128",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Transparency and effectiveness",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Integrate your management with the ordering processes to ensure you always order what you need at the exact time. Identify problems in the production process and ensure smooth operations.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
